An unresolved image gives its whole caption slot back, at any depth

```
![a][r]
^ cap one
continued
.
<p>![a][r]
^ cap one
continued</p>
```

```
![a][r]
^ cap one
continued

[r]: /u
.
<figure>
  <img src="/u" alt="a">
  <figcaption>cap one
continued</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
- ![a][r]
  ^ cap
.
<ul>
  <li>![a][r]
^ cap</li>
</ul>
```

```
- ![a][r]
  ^ cap

[r]: /u
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <figure>
      <img src="/u" alt="a">
      <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </li>
</ul>
```
